# Attract mode (data/attract.json): the Embarcadero. Rolling north-west up the Embarcadero in front of
# the Ferry Building (traffic cleared), the clock tower going by on the right: a kickflip, a heelflip
# and a manual on the way. Then EMB: across the brick plaza at 4 m/s beside a ledge of a row, an ollie
# and a 50-50 down its whole 10 m (the sf-grind-emb line), landed and rolled away.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
bot balance
cmd 1 teleport 742.5 687.6 -9.3 323.5
cmd 20 speed 7.5
hold up 24..54
hold ollie 200..222
tap flip+left 228
hold up 380..410
hold ollie 520..542
tap flip+right 548
tap up 700
tap down 705
hold ollie 880..896
cmd 1300 teleport 568.85 708.35 -8.93 141.8
cmd 1302 set skater.vel.x 2.472
cmd 1302 set skater.vel.y -3.144
hold ollie 1304..1314
tap grind 1322
run 1900
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} within 230..290
expect event trickEnd{trick=Heelflip} within 550..610
expect event comboLanded{name=Manual} within 1000..1010
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50,line=ledge_569_708} within 1326..1330
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 50-50 + EMB LEDGE} within 1730..1750
expect no event bail
